  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十九关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ミーシャのことはWが連れて行ってくれたはず……！　ここは俺たちで、なんとか時間を稼ぐぞ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "こいつらを絶対に通すな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ああ！　好きにさせてたまるかってんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "ホシグマ",
      "speakerToken": "char_136_hsguma",
      "operatorId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "portraitKey": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "――死にたくなければ、おとなしく道をあけろ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "う、うわああっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "あ～らら……そういえばロドスにも、ああいう乱暴な戦い方する人がいたわよね。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "あの刑事さんとなら、気が合いそうだと思わない？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "よそ見しないの！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "リスカム",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "ほら、動いて！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "は～いはい、わかったわかった。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "あははっ！　前から聞いてはいたけど、督察隊の噂って本当だったんだね～。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "いいから集中しろ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "大丈夫大丈夫！　こうやってお喋りしながら……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "ちゃんと周りも見てるんだから！　――はい、バーン！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン術師",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "ぐあっ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "へっへ～ん。そこに隠れてる攻撃部隊、気付かれてないとでも思ってたのかな？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "やるな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "エクシア",
      "speakerToken": "char_103_angel_1",
      "operatorId": "char_103_angel",
      "portraitKey": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "でしょ？　ふっふっふ～。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "……では、我々も行くとしよう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "テキサス",
      "speakerToken": "char_102_texas_1",
      "operatorId": "char_102_texas",
      "portraitKey": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "雇い主を放ってはおけないしな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ミーシャさんの姿はありましたか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "さっぱりね。それらしい痕跡も見当たらないわ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "もしかすると、Wに連れて行かれたのかも。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "フランカ",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "ほんと、逃げ足だけは速いんだから――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "っ……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "今の爆発は……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "フランカさん、全隊を招集してください！　近衛局の支援に回らなければ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "ロドスの皆さん、どうかお気をつけて！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "相手はあの……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "……待てよ……そんなこと、ありえるのか……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……？　どういうことですか？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "それに、相手というのは――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――え？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "あれは……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "ど、どうして彼が……！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "……何、だと……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "チッ、一体どういうからくりだ？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "――奇跡だ……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "奇跡が起きたんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "――――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "何が、どうなって……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "――ぼやぼやするな、遮蔽物を探すんだ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "本当に、こんなことが……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "お前……なのか？　生きてたんだな！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "無事だったのか！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "よ、よかった……！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "スカルシュレッダーは生きてる！　生きてるぞ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "スカルシュレッダー！　本物のスカルシュレッダーだ！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "万歳！！　万歳！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……まさか……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……そんな、はずが……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "レユニオンの連中……隊長格の復帰で、士気が高まったようだな。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "厄介なことになったものだ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "……実際、不利な状況に変わりはない。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "だが、お前が戻ってきてくれただけでも……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "よかったよ。……本当に、よかった……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "……きっと今頃、ミーシャも無事に離脱を終えているだろう。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "となれば、俺たちも安心して博打が打てるって寸法だ！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "――いいや。俺が、ここで奴らの足止めをする。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "お前たちは、早く行け。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "背中は守ってやる。だから――"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "何言ってんだよ、スカルシュレッダー。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "レユニオン構成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "俺たち、約束してただろ？　一緒にウルサスへ帰って、あの連中を懲らしめてやろうってさ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "スカルシュレッダー",
      "speakerToken": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "operatorId": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1500_skulsr",
      "text": "とにかく、自分の安全に気を配ってくれ。……死ぬなよ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "アーミヤ",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#5",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "そんな……そんなことって……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "何をしている、ぼーっとするな！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "ホシグマ、包囲に当たっている局員たちへ連絡を！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "トラップと伏兵はあらかた排除したが、敵幹部であるW及び、保護対象の人物は依然未確認の状況だ。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "ゆえに、作戦を変更する。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "チェン",
